  "body": "## Highlights\n\n- **Keep your newer layout.** Starting another device no longer replaces a newer Cloud layout with its untouched local copy; if both devices edit offline, the later edit wins once they reconnect. Update both devices. (#1816)\n- **The top bar fits.** Update status gives way before Help and the market summary, so “Update ready” and Restart no longer paint over them in the desktop app. (#1815)\n- **Chat reads as written.** Bold, italic, code, links, lists and quotes render in chat on the desktop and terminal, including messages bridged from Discord. (#1814)\n- **Clearer financial figures.** Quotes agree across spellings of one listing, enterprise value uses one close, short interest names its settlement and availability dates, and futures name the contract month and price unit. (#1798, #1805, #1807, #1809, #1811)\n\n## Also in this release\n\n- Changelog’s Full diff opens the comparison instead of showing raw markdown. (#1797)\n- Six panes show cached rows while fresh data loads; unchanged ticks avoid needless redraws. (#1800, #1801)\n- Unknown commands suggest catalog matches, and locked or empty CLI reports explain what to do next. (#1804, #1806)\n- Watchlist imports handle pasted symbols and exit with an error when none resolve. (#1808)\n- Index quotes distinguish points from dollars, and the glossary explains more beginner terms. (#1810)\n\n[Full diff](https://github.com/gloom-sh/gloomberb/compare/v0.17.2...v0.17.3)\n"
}
